@startuml user-hierarchy
!pragma layout smetana
title Uptrail / CATS - shared user inheritance
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
abstract class User {
  userId : Long
  userName : String
  name : String
  staffId : String
}
class Staff
class Manager
class Admin
User <|-- Staff
Staff <|-- Manager
User <|-- Admin
note right of Manager
  Same inherited userId and staffId.
  Uses Staff application pages.
  Decides assigned team requests.
  Cannot approve own application.
end note
note bottom of User
  Login stores a password-free subtype
  in session "user".
  One identity across all MVC pages.
end note
@enduml
